<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭper-cresco</span></b> , crēvi,
		3, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>To grow up</i>, <i>over</i>, or <i>upon</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carcinoma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					5, 28, 2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 28, 22 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			—With dat.,
				<i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. A. 3, 15</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fortuna quod supercresceret caritati, i. e.,</span>”
				<i>might join</i>, <i>be added to</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. Decl. 5</span></i>
			 14 <i>fin.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to excel</i>, <i>outdo</i>: municipalem habitum, August. c. Acad. 1,
			2. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
